# Scope prettier ignore to the runtime-generated outputs under .qfai so SSOT
# sources (.qfai/specs, .qfai/assistant, .qfai/contracts, .qfai/discussion)
# stay formatted. Negate only the authored files that should remain
# auto-formatted (`README.md` and the preflight summary). Historical evidence
# markdown stays ignored so frozen records do not churn under auto-formatting.
# Parent directories are also explicitly un-ignored so the negated file
# entries survive prettier's gitignore-style matching.
.qfai/report/**
!.qfai/report/
!.qfai/report/README.md
!.qfai/report/preflight_summary.md
.qfai/review/**
!.qfai/review/
!.qfai/review/README.md
.qfai/evidence/**
!.qfai/evidence/
!.qfai/evidence/README.md
pnpm-lock.yaml
tmp
*.min.js
*.min.css

# Generated QFAI artifacts (not versioned)
.qfai/review/review-*
.qfai/review_archive/review-*
.qfai/evidence/*[0-9]*.md
.qfai/evidence/*[0-9]*.json
.qfai/report/run-*
.qfai/report/validate.*
.qfai/report/report.md
.qfai/report/atdd-traceability
.qfai/report/preflight_summary.md
.qfai/report/specs-coverage
